# 99-published/

Official, signed-off document packages for `{{PROJECT_TITLE}}`.

Conventions:

- One subfolder per version, e.g. `v0.1/`, `v1.0/`.
- Each version includes a `published-package-index.md` listing artifacts,
  maturity at publish time, and approver.
- Files here are immutable once published. New content goes to a new
  version folder.

Producer: `prepare-published-package` (see `.harness/commands.yml`).
